 OptionsTool_BigFont;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean;s
⍝ Presents a list (typically small) with check boxes
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←'White' 'Red' 'Green' 'Yellow' 'Black' 'Pink' 'Magenta' 'Black' 'Blue' ⍝'abc' 'xyz' 'qwe' '123' '4567' '2' '345'
 parms←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Select proper color'
 parms.info←'Select the most appropriate color(s):'
 #.⎕SHADOW'MyFonts'
 #.MyFonts←∆CreateFonts 48
⍝ parms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel fontAPL)←#.MyFonts.(standard input label apl)
 globalParms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel fontAPL)←#.MyFonts.(standard input label apl)
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Create list

 (flag boolean)←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.ModalWait n1
 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
